NOWAYOS: display-stub: frame 3 on the framebuffer, scan-out hash 0xa1a6c1e2b51a9df2
NOWAYOS: display-stub: frame 4 hash 0x1f109f765165f4fd
NOWAYOS: display-stub: frame 4 on the framebuffer, scan-out hash 0x1f109f765165f4fd
